  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "每位国王都有专属牌库，可按想偷的兵种宣战、按不需要的单位议和",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Each of the kings has a different starting deck of buildings, troops, and spells, but you can loot the rival kings who attack your lands to access cards from their unique decks. Make peace with those whose units don’t fit your playstyle, and declare war against kings with the powers and units you covet, deploying the tools acquired from your enemy to unlock countless combinations of stacking buffs and modifiers to build an invincible army.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2784470/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "异步多人让你同时对抗八位国王，比拼谁的王国能存活最久",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Async multiplayer mode pits you against eight rival kings to see whose kingdom survives the longest.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2784470/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "任务模式改写基础规则收集王冠，无尽模式则承受敌王无限轮番进攻",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Quest Mode introduces unique mechanics-bending challenges as you travel the known world and face off against its kings to collect their crowns for yourself. Endless Mode has you choose a king and face endless attacks from enemy kings and their most powerful warriors – how long can you survive the onslaught?",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2784470/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
